  "description": "Operating Area: France, Italy, Greece, Turkey, Virgin Islands, The Leeward Islands, The Windward Islands, The Bahamas, Bermuda\n\nAt 50 metres, this steel sailing yacht redefines freedom on the water. Designed with six elegant guest cabins, including a full-beam master suite, she accommodates guests in complete comfort and privacy.\n\nA unique central corridor runs directly through the glass-enclosed engine room, a breathtaking design feature that lets guests walk between its two illuminated sides.\n\nThe heart of the yacht is revealed in perfect silence, combining innovation with elegance.\nWith an unrestricted navigation certificate, she stands among a rare few yachts capable of crossing oceans with guests aboard, combining true sailing capability with resort-level luxury.\n\nThe 96-square-metre main saloon and spacious flybridge invite guests to gather, unwind, and savour every horizon in style.",
